# Environment of the OpenShell gateway on Linux. osh picks the file for this machine by OS and
# architecture (gateway-linux.env, gateway-macos-arm64.env, gateway-macos-x86_64.env).
# Nothing to set: the systemd user manager's PATH finds Docker and Podman, and their sockets are
# where the gateway looks. Add KEY=value lines here to change the gateway's environment.
